class_name DropConfig
## Tunable drop rate constants. Edit these to adjust loot frequency.

## Chance that an enemy drops anything at all (0.0 - 1.0)
const DROP_CHANCE := 0.20

## When a drop occurs, chance it's an item vs meseta (0.0 - 1.0)
## e.g. 0.30 = 30% item, 70% meseta
const ITEM_VS_MESETA := 0.30
